---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Frequently Asked Questions"
  description="Answers to common questions about Siryus Hub, SIRYUS A.M, services, and community."
>
  <h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>
  <p class="marketing-lede">
    Quick answers about Siryus Hub and SIRYUS A.M. For anything else, use the
    <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What is Siryus Hub?</h2>
  <p>
    Siryus Hub is the digital home for independent creatives connecting with education, marketing, management, and
    community initiatives led by SIRYUS A.M and Siryus Creative Media Ltd.
  </p>

  <h2>What is SIRYUS A.M?</h2>
  <p>
    SIRYUS A.M (SIRYUS Artist Management) focuses on artist management, marketing, and career support for independent
    creatives.
  </p>

  <h2>How do I get in touch?</h2>
  <p>
    Email
    <a href="mailto:management@siryushub.com">management@siryushub.com</a>
    or use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Where can I read legal information?</h2>
  <p>
    See our
    <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>,
    <a href="/terms-of-use">Terms of Use</a>, and
    <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
